extMarkTextContent":"處方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" :"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黃附子細辛湯，調胃承氣湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (科中)      三餐飯前服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-htyqp5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-htyqp5x","updated":"20240522085119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"當天晚餐前第一次服， 服完約2小時後開始排黑便，晚上11點肚子餓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (胃氣回復)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-uzf9fjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-uzf9fjd","updated":"20240522084954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008.07.15"}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-ije3jqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-ije3jqc","updated":"20240522084954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白天排便多次成粗條狀, 自述中脘處已不痛，精神很好，打算下午去游泳. 治療完畢."}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-qp704mm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-qp704mm","updated":"20240522084954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"                                                                      弟子 小毛 敬書"}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-qrxtann","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-qrxtann","updated":"20240522085004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-k0yw105","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-k0yw105","updated":"20240522084954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者看完這個案例後，感覺如何呢? 西藥真爛，只會傷人腸胃，從未聞過西藥可以治療任何的胃病，西醫連個簡單的胃病都治不好，如何治療胃癌呢? 只要醫學理論是正確的，何籌治不好病呢? 這種一劑就知的效果，世上只有經方家可以做到，溫病派是無法做到的，看到同學學習經方有成，心中真是快慰，讓我們一起加油，將經方宏揚到國際上，將中醫治不好病的汙名改成，只有中醫可以真正的治好病。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084954-o3i99aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084954-o3i99aa","updated":"20240522084954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海厦謹記07/24/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522084955-8wrfzo2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522084955-8wrfzo2"}},{"ID":"20240522084956-aujidfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084956-aujidfv"}}]}